 "sentences": [
  "This shrub hides its flowers inside itself.",
  "Banksia aculeata grows only in Western Australia’s Stirling Range.",
  "These plants reach up to 2 meters tall with very prickly leaves.",
  "Its unusual pinkish flower spikes hang down during early summer.",
  "Unlike many banksias, it lacks a woody base.",
  "Fire kills this rare plant, but it regenerates from seeds.",
  "Surprisingly, it resists a deadly soil mold."
